Processing by IssuesController#update as HTML
  Parameters: {"utf8"=>"✓", "authenticity_token"=>"gK6Z09bBGl7P8SiyUIVF35RcNnICHRWz5//D0/Z8tfU=", "issue"=>{"is_private"=>"0", "project_id"=>"38", "tracker_id"=>"4", "subject"=>"Mobile | Macau Game | Slot Game - Auto Spin Error ", "description"=>"<p><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>I. Incident&nbsp;summary</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><em>[Capped at 250 words]</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Received member feedback in the morning time at 5:00AM inquiry when while playing the Auto Spin, suddenly pop up an Error message</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><em>&quot;Please contact CSD regarding bet limit settings.&quot; </em></strong>Member sitll have bet credit but not able to continue the game.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>II. Incident Details</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Usrname : GMK988SS004</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Macau Game: Fish&#39;o Mania</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We have tested other slot game also encountered the same problem, kindly refer to the below test result :-</p>\r\n\r\n<p>below is the Macau games (slot game) we test with Auto spin till half (each round is inconsistant) then will have error &quot;Please contact CSD regarding bet limit settings.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Internal test user : staffss03007 and STAFF8888000 - via browser test</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Wolf Quest &gt; spin till 43 error pop out<br />\r\nFish&#39;o Mania &gt; Spin till 54 error pop out<br />\r\nBig Haul &gt; Spin till 56 error pop out<br />\r\nDancing Lions &gt; Spin till 44 error pop out<br />\r\nGold of Ra &gt; Spin till 63 error pop out<br />\r\nTemple Treasures &gt; spin till 20 error pop out</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Auto 50</strong>Dragons and Pearls &gt; spin till 30 error pop out<br />\r\nPhoenix Princess &gt; spin finished auto 50 then click another auto 50 after 6 spin then error pop out</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Auto 20</strong><br />\r\nFortune Panda &gt; spin finished auto 20 then click another auto 20 after 3 spin then error pop out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>III. Chronological Order of Events</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"height:95px; width:533px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Date &amp; Time (GMT+8)</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Description &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">10th Nov @4:20PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Seek for Thomas, he was in meeting</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">10th Nov @ 4:35PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Raise this issue to internal skype</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">10th Nov @ 4:37PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Michael replied will assist Thomas checked this issue</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">10th Nov @ 5:00PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Thomas replied already inoformed API team to checked the log and will run auto spin to test it.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">10th Nov @ 7:31PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>Thomas informed Jane skype they found the problem :-</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>[7:31:13 PM] Thomas Chou: we store the bet limit in our cache, when we extend member&#39;s token, will also extend bet limit cache.<br />\r\n\t\t\t[7:33:21 PM] Thomas Chou: but recently we change the extend the key format for N7 project, and that caused bet limit cache extend faild.<br />\r\n\t\t\t[7:33:51 PM] Thomas Chou: so about the 300 seconds, will ran into such error.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>And will hot fix by tomorrow.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">10th Nov @ 8:16PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>Thomas update at internal skype group :-</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>Hi Jane, the team have found the root cause for this issue that due to supporting other projects, we have made some changes in the system. the team had fixed and tested it. we will deploy this fix tomorrow morning when there are less members online, and will notify you once it&#39;s done for you to check again. thanks.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "status_id"=>"5", "priority_id"=>"3", "assigned_to_id"=>"55", "start_date"=>"2016-11-10", "due_date"=>"2016-11-11", "custom_field_values"=>{"8"=>["N/A", ""], "3"=>["N/A", ""], "23"=>["Mobile", ""], "4"=>["API", ""], "19"=>"There is only one member feedback.", "15"=>"", "7"=>"Due to supporting other projects, we have made some changes in the system. and that affected bet limit cache mechanism.", "17"=>"NIL", "16"=>"Change code and deploy the hot fix"}, "notes"=>"", "private_notes"=>"0", "lock_version"=>"6"}, "issue_template"=>"", "last_journal_id"=>"296", "commit"=>"Submit", "id"=>"91"}
