Processing by IssuesController#update_form as JS
  Parameters: {"utf8"=>"✓", "authenticity_token"=>"comnNyHsjRKFW6hwSekq1wpD6kSLuahpibLwen9dd1A=", "issue"=>{"is_private"=>"0", "project_id"=>"24", "tracker_id"=>"4", "subject"=>"  Nap Site | Special Delete | Void Early Kick Off Bet", "description"=>"<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>I. Incident&nbsp;summary</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><em>[Capped at 250 words]</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We used Void Early Kick Off Bet function, found a weird case when load all tickets, the team name not same with member bet detail, In fact we input correct Match ID.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>II. Incident Details</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Date: 10-Nov<br />\r\nKick Off: 6:00PM (Match Early Kick Off 1 hour 15 minutes)<br />\r\nLeague: BANGLADESH CHAMPIONSHIP LEAGUE &nbsp;<br />\r\nMatch: Fakirapool Young Mens Club (n) -vs-T&amp;T Sporting Club</p>\r\n\r\n<p>First Time paste Match ID via Early Kick Off function search ticket void, found member bet detail team name not same.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Actual team name : Fakirapool Young Mens Club (n) -vs-T&amp;T Sporting Club</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Wrong team name : Clube Sao Minguel De Taleigao U20 -vs- SC Goa U20</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Re paste and search again the ticket, then finally show correct team name at the ticket.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>======================= Kiwi@20161111 ======================================</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As per skype conference call with Jane. she provided steps to search tickets before CSD void as below:<br />\r\n1. CS-Jennifer searched by using MatchId 20768935. with this machid, its MatchName is Clube Sao Minguel De Taleigao U20 -vs- SC Goa U20. There was no ticket displayed at this step.<br />\r\n2. CS-Jennifer realized that she searched wrong matchID.<br />\r\n3. CS-Jennifer searched another correct matchid = 20768745 and Event Start Date (GMT +8) = 2016-11-10 17:00:00. However, the system returened with wrong teamname/matchname Clube Sao Minguel De Taleigao U20 -vs- SC Goa U20<br />\r\n4. CS-Jennifer searched again with the same matchid = 20768745 and Event Start Date (GMT +8) = 2016-11-10 17:00:00. This time, the system could return correct teamname/matchname Fakirapool Young Mens Club (n) -vs-T&amp;T Sporting Club</p>\r\n\r\n<p>REASON to face with this issue:<br />\r\nat step #1, the system stored the matchid 20768935 in our RemotingRef cache service. by right, at step #3, this RemotingRef Cache service must recognize the NEW matchid 20768745 to provide us correct data returned. we suspect that there is a problem with this cache during that time.<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\nThis issue isn&#39;t causing you to void wrong tickets at all because we pass to tell DB void by BetID, not by matchid. It&#39;s only affecting to the displaying issue and make you feel confused.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>================================== Kiwi@20161111 =======================</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After we have cheked with RD, below are 2 scenarios causing this issue happend.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Scenario1:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>User 1 login on 1st browser</li>\r\n\t<li>User 2 login on 2nd browser</li>\r\n\t<li>User 1 search with matchID A on 1st browser&nbsp;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; <em><strong>Observed</strong></em>: tickets A1, A2, A3 of match A are&nbsp;searched with matchA information</li>\r\n\t<li>User 2 search with matchID A&nbsp;on 2nd browser &gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><strong>Observed</strong></em>: tickets A1, A2, A3 of match A are&nbsp;searched with matchA information</li>\r\n\t<li>User 1 search again with matchID B on 1st browser &gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&nbsp;<em><strong>Observed</strong></em>: tickets B1, B2&nbsp;of match B&nbsp;are&nbsp;searched <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">with matchA information</span> (with fixed code: <em><strong>Observed</strong></em>: tickets B1, B2&nbsp;of match B&nbsp;are&nbsp;searched <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">with matchB information</span>)</li>\r\n\t<li>User 1&nbsp;search again with matchID B on 1st browser &gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&nbsp;<em><strong>Observed</strong></em>: tickets B1, B2&nbsp;of match B&nbsp;are&nbsp;searched&nbsp;with matchB information</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Scenario 2</strong>:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>User login</li>\r\n\t<li>User opens 2 tabs on same&nbsp;browser both point to early KO url</li>\r\n\t<li>User performs search matchID A on tab1 &gt;&gt;&gt;&nbsp;<em><strong>Observed</strong></em>: tickets A1, A2, A3 of match A are&nbsp;searched with matchA information</li>\r\n\t<li>User performs search matchID B on tab2&nbsp;&gt;&gt;&gt;&nbsp;<em><strong>Observed</strong></em>: tickets B1, B2 of match B&nbsp;are&nbsp;searched with matchB&nbsp;information</li>\r\n\t<li>User keeps the same betlist showed and inputed matchID A&nbsp;at step 3 on tab1, click button search again &gt;&gt;&gt; <strong>Observed</strong>:&nbsp;tickets A1, A2, A3 of match A are&nbsp;searched again<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"> with matchB information on tab1</span> (with fixed code: <em><strong>Observed</strong></em>: tickets A1, A2, A3 of match A are&nbsp;searched <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">with matchA information on tab1</span>)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>III. Chronological Order of Events</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:500px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Date &amp; Time (GMT+8)</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Description &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">10th Nov @ 10:11PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Raise this issue to Channel skype group, Gary assist checked this issue</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "status_id"=>"5", "priority_id"=>"3", "assigned_to_id"=>"10", "start_date"=>"2016-11-10", "due_date"=>"2016-11-16", "custom_field_values"=>{"8"=>["Sportsbook", ""], "3"=>["NAP-Special Delete", ""], "23"=>["Desktop", ""], "4"=>["Application", ""], "19"=>"N/A", "15"=>"", "7"=>"glitch code in the web application cache service", "17"=>"", "16"=>"Rectify the coding of cache service to get correct MatchId"}, "notes"=>"<p>Kiwi Tran (SAS) wrote:</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>Dear Erica, We&#39;ve released the fix to resolve for this issue. Thanks.</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>&nbsp;</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>Hi, Kiwi,</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>Noted we will close case</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "private_notes"=>"0", "lock_version"=>"7"}, "issue_template"=>"", "last_journal_id"=>"317", "id"=>"93", "project_id"=>"special-delete"}
