Started POST "/projects/allbet/issues/update_form.js" for 121.127.16.91 at 2016-11-15 23:02:09 +0800
Processing by IssuesController#update_form as JS
  Parameters: {"utf8"=>"✓", "authenticity_token"=>"5skt27SINjRlrBVfk3TkKhOpA0bfwgezyUTgBKZdhkQ=", "issue"=>{"is_private"=>"0", "tracker_id"=>"4", "subject"=>"", "description"=>"<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>I. Incident&nbsp;summary</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(255, 0, 0)\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><em>[Capped at 250 words]</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Allbet product &gt; missed mapping&nbsp;betting limit 250 - 25,000 for Super level.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>II. Incident Details</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>CSD found new created Super User MY &gt; Allbet &gt; betting limit 250 - 25,000 no tick and this user is copy from user MQ also no tick.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8:18pm, Informed Skype (CSD contacts Starix Channel) to check.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8:27pm, Kiwi informed &gt; refer to Live Baccarat Game Setting there are 4 stake levels 25-3,000; 75-7,500; 250-10,000; 750-30,000</p>\r\n\r\n<p>[8:35:50 PM] Starix IT-Kiwi: you can see that the rule to map between SLI LC and Allbet&nbsp;&gt; row 30 &amp; 31 (please refer to attached file)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SLI &nbsp; &nbsp;=&gt; &nbsp; Allbet<br />\r\n25-3,000 =&gt; 40-4,000<br />\r\n75-7,500 =&gt; 100-10,000<br />\r\n250-10,000 =&gt; 100-10,000<br />\r\n750-30,000 =&gt; 300-30,000</p>\r\n\r\n<p>[8:37:14 PM] Starix IT-Kiwi: 250-10,000 =&gt; 100-10,000 while copying from LC to AB beside this, we leave 250-10,000 of AB un-ticked it means that we didn&#39;t consider what we should deal with 250-10,000 at the launching time that&#39;s why there is no Super offered 250-10,000 for ALLBET at the launching time except these supers HID, RGIDO, AGD, ZA, RG2DO, MY. it seems that these supers were adjusted manually by csd</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Peter (Allbet PIC) will check with Celine for this issue.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>PENDING KIWI FURTHER UPDATE</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><strong>III. Chronological Order of Events</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:500px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Date &amp; Time (GMT+8)</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Description &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 2016&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>CSD found&nbsp;new created Super MY (Indo currency) &gt; Allbet &gt; betting limit 250 - 25,000 no tick and this user is copy from user MQ also no tick.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>15 Nov 2016 &amp; 8:18pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Informed Skype (CSD contacts Starix Channel) to check.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 2016 &amp; 8:27pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>Kiwi informed they&nbsp;copy setting to Allbet &gt;&nbsp;make 75 - 7,500 &amp; 250 - 10,000 become the same 100 - 10,000&nbsp;there was NO mapping from LC to Allbet for 250 - 25,000&nbsp;that&#39;s why at Super level, this 250 - 25,000 is un-ticked.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 2016 &amp; 8:52pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Peter will check with Celine for this case whether need to tick also&nbsp;250 - 25,000 for Super.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "status_id"=>"2", "priority_id"=>"3", "assigned_to_id"=>"", "start_date"=>"2016-11-15", "due_date"=>"", "custom_field_values"=>{"8"=>["N/A", ""], "3"=>["N/A", ""], "23"=>[""], "4"=>[""], "19"=>"N/A", "15"=>"", "7"=>"N/A", "17"=>"", "16"=>""}}, "issue_template"=>"51", "project_id"=>"allbet"}
