rong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Description &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 16 &amp; 7:59pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Member SEA1639699 asking why his Virtual sports tickets not yet payout?</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 16 &amp; 8:07pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Informed to NOC Feir then he claimed that RD is going home most fast also need wait for half hour.&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 16 &amp; 8:55pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NOC Feir informed after RD checked claimed that the ticket kick off time is 10:16PM so cannot proceed payout. CSD checked currently member site only offer Virtual soccer with kick off time 9:37PM why member able place bet for 10:16PM event.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 16 &amp; 9:22pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>NOC Feir informed RD will check and inform root cause on tomorrow.&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">15 Nov 16 &amp; 10:16pm</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>CSD check member ticket done payout.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "status_id"=>"3", "priority_id"=>"3", "assigned_to_id"=>"16", "start_date"=>"2016-11-15", "due_date"=>"", "custom_field_values"=>{"8"=>["Virtual Sport", ""], "3"=>["Credit-Member", ""], "23"=>["Desktop", ""], "4"=>["Others", ""], "19"=>"N/A", "15"=>"SEA1639699", "7"=>"N/A", "17"=>"", "16"=>""}, "notes"=>"", "private_notes"=>"0", "lock_version"=>"0"}, "issue_template"=>"", "last_journal_id"=>"", "id"=>"103", "project_id"=>"virtual-sport"}
