mer has tried but issue still persisted.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Nov 9, 7:57PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>PM_Martin updated:&nbsp;目前檢查的結果我們的程式邏輯是有點問題,&nbsp;麻煩幫我們開一張IM.&nbsp;我們明天請負責的工程師處理</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Nov 10, 10:00AM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>告知RD,RD已開始查詢及解決問題</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Nov 10, 14:00PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>已修改完畢,驗證沒問題.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Nov 11, 11:00AM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>上Code</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "status_id"=>"3", "priority_id"=>"3", "assigned_to_id"=>"93", "start_date"=>"2016-11-09", "due_date"=>"2016-11-11", "custom_field_values"=>{"8"=>["Gold Deluxe-Live Casino", ""], "3"=>["Licensee-Frontend", ""], "23"=>["Desktop", ""], "4"=>["3rd Party", ""], "19"=>"N/A", "15"=>"HonorWRMB012392 (nc_13703537052)", "7"=>"因為進入3rdparty的遊戲多做了一個判斷,若體育沒有金額的話就需要存錢,所以導至己存錢在AG/GD的會員無法登入.", "17"=>"N/A", "16"=>"將機制改為只有single wallet的遊戲才要做體育有沒有錢的判斷."}, "notes"=>"", "private_notes"=>"0", "lock_version"=>"1"}, "issue_template"=>"", "last_journal_id"=>"329", "commit"=>"Submit", "id"=>"89"}
