mer has tried but issue still persisted.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Nov 9, 7:57PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>PM_Martin updated:&nbsp;目前檢查的結果我們的程式邏輯是有點問題,&nbsp;麻煩幫我們開一張IM.&nbsp;我們明天請負責的工程師處理</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Nov 10, 10:00AM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>告知RD,RD已開始查詢及解決問題</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Nov 10, 14:00PM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>已修改完畢,驗證沒問題.</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center\">Nov 11, 11:00AM</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>上Code</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "status_id"=>"3", "priority_id"=>"3", "assigned_to_id"=>"93", "start_date"=>"2016-11-09", "due_date"=>"2016-11-11", "custom_field_values"=>{"8"=>["Gold Deluxe-Live Casino", ""], "3"=>["Licensee-Frontend", ""], "23"=>["Desktop", ""], "4"=>["3rd Party", ""], "19"=>"N/A", "15"=>"HonorWRMB012392 (nc_13703537052)", "7"=>"Application forbids member without sports balance from accessing 3rd party game. however, AG/GD uses separate wallet. Thus Remove AG/GD from the check list.", "17"=>"N/A", "16"=>"Change the mechanism to \"check member sports balance for single wallet products only\" before access 3rd party."}, "notes"=>"", "private_notes"=>"0", "lock_version"=>"2"}, "issue_template"=>"", "last_journal_id"=>"332", "commit"=>"Submit", "id"=>"89"}
